  abilityName: Mindtangling Bolt
  abilityDesc: 16 combo Light attack on all foes, 3 combo Light attack on single
    foe (damage relative to remaining HP), boosts Atk relative to max HP for 3 turns,
    boosts BB Atk for 3 turns, probable evasion for 2 turns & boosts own spark damage
    for 1 turn
